  ("logic-board","Logic board","compute","The board connects the processor to memory, storage, ports and power. In thin laptops it is small and densely packed.",None),
  ("cooling","Heat pipe and fan","compute","A copper heat pipe carries heat from the chip to fins, and a blower fan pushes air through them and out of the vents.","Inside a heat pipe, liquid boils at the hot end and the vapour condenses at the cool end, carrying heat far better than solid copper."),
