 title="How a Graphics Card Works: Interactive 3D GPU Teardown",
 desc="Take a graphics card apart in 3D: GPU chip, video memory, power stages, heat pipes, fins, fans, shroud and backplate. Then put it under load and watch it cool.",
 card="GPU, VRAM, heat pipes and three fans.",
